{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Time Avarice</strong>, time is both your enemy and ally.\u00a0 Each stage offers the chance to buy power-ups, shaping a unique gameplay experience with every run. Use the time you've earned to select different power-ups, each choice impacting your journey.  When the clock runs out, time's up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tiers of power-ups through repeated play, enhancing the depth and replayability of each run into this arcade-inspired space humble roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Time is a critical resource: Manage it wisely by destroying enemies and choosing power-ups.  Don't get greedy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Varied runs: Different power-ups available in each playthrough allow for diverse strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable power-up tiers: Repeated play unlocks more options, adding variety to your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is no escape, just a higher score</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2850860?t=1766573564","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/451d3dc4b9a389f966e395e2a56c14dba766e802/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766573564","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/2609b468f84d4634bcd1a363f6cae9760986fa2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766573564","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/2609b468f84d4634bcd1a363f6cae9760986fa2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766573564","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Time Avarice</strong>, time is both your enemy and ally.\u00a0 Each stage offers the chance to buy power-ups, shaping a unique gameplay experience with every run. Use the time you've earned to select different power-ups, each choice impacting your journey.  When the clock runs out, time's up. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new tiers of power-ups through repeated play, enhancing the depth and replayability of each run into this arcade-inspired space humble roguelite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Time is a critical resource: Manage it wisely by destroying enemies and choosing power-ups.  Don't get greedy! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Varied runs: Different power-ups available in each playthrough allow for diverse strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unlockable power-up tiers: Repeated play unlocks more options, adding variety to your game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There is no escape, just a higher score</h2>","developers":["Desastreger"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850860/7fdde5f8e503f01a884e316544dba718e0f89c3c/header.jpg?t=1766573564","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2850860/234026965/40729b3a16dd846059d6da78475ada66fef998bd/1766573407/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766573562","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2850860/234026965/40729b3a16dd846059d6da78475ada66fef998bd/1766573407/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766573562","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2850860/234026965/40729b3a16dd846059d6da78475ada66fef998bd/1766573407/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766573562","id":257006227,"name":"T